        },
        {
          "text": "“Eeshiina fuga Israeli, siida iyadayda lukghumeeda was haleanjeadaanyi bea ghadooweeda hoyyoo bea NG'UTAMIIDA gaygweadu haleanjeadaanyi bea ghadooweeda heeda NG'UTAMIIDA; leabu jeeda lukghumeadaanyi was haleanjeadaanyi bea ghadooweeda bea hoyyoo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaygweana geatingaaschi haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda heeda NG'UTAMIIDA; gaygweadu ghashneeda sea giyooda, nea giyooda gajeegatkat eekeal humng'eeda ak geatayda ghoah haleanjeeda ghadooweeda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghaghwarda ashoohoocheanda ghashneeda aba heeda wagiida, nea giyooda gaygaba Haruni sea orjoagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gibeesta geatinda dugwa gajadawa ashoohoocheanda ghoah haleanjeeda ghadooweeda leabu lukghumeeda was haleanjeeda ghadooweadaang'u bea hoyyoo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeeda orjooga Haruni jea ghoadayda foojeanda haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea hoyyoo ea ghashneeda gayghwanyas gibeesta geatinda dugwa ghoah daanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba giyoodida siiyuugiin ea geeshtida siitaydaan geageandeawi heeda fuga Israeli, aba heeda lukghumajeega was haleanjeeda nyaawa bea ghadooweeda bea hoyyoo, ak ghoadaw Haruneeda was ashoohoocheanda sea orjoagaaschi, ghoah gichea gwasina fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih saruuta Haruni gil ea orjoagaaschi was haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sisna beasta bea NG'UTAMIIDA, eaweeda sirarsiina saawa damanda siloada ghoah ashoohoodiga NG'UTAMIIDA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA gwarugu ng'asheanji gideaba eatawa fuga Israeli, eaweeda ghayi simwaara; ak gayghoah gichea gwasina aba seaygoojiga nyaawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
