        {
          "text": "Nih deaweedeeda haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda, was dearanga riing'eeda, ea haleanjeeda sighadoawanda aba badayda riing'eeda, ea haleanjeeda sighadoawanda aba badayda giidiinyeanda, ea dea giimbiita, ea dea haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea hoyyoo, ",
